---
title: RISC-V Instruction Extensions
layout: layout.njk
---
<h1>The Best RISC-V Instruction Set Reference Manual</h1>

<p>
Browse the instruction set by extension. Pick an extension to see every instruction defined inside it.
</p>

<p class="primary-callout">
The base integer <strong>I</strong> extension is the most widely implemented set of instructions. Start there if you're looking for the core ISA.
</p>

<ul id="extensions">
{% for ext in extensions %}
    <li data-name="{{ ext.name | lower }}">
        <a href="/extensions/{{ ext.slug }}/">{{ ext.name }}</a>
        <p class="extension-description">
            {% if ext.description %}
                {{ ext.description }}
            {% else %}
                Description coming soon.
            {% endif %}
        </p>
    </li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>

<p class="secondary-callout">
<a href="/search/">Try the searchable instruction index.</a>
</p>
